	(text "Input: downstream of hardware RBF / deployment / solar OV.\nOutput shunt: 20 mOhm, 1%; slow limit 2.38–2.63 A.\nFeedback: 31.6k / 10k, 0.1%; nominal 4.992 V.\nUVLO divider: 39.2k / 16.9k, 0.1%; ~4.08 V rising.\nPG pull-up uses independent essential +3V3 (status only).\nDo not release heavy loads before PG and startup settle."
		(at 40.64 180.34 0)
